ity-transitivity\">67-thm-interpretability-transitivity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 5，印刷页 81；PDF 第 92 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"已核对 Theorem 5 陈述和从 Lemma 2 的推导；底层算术化完备性保留 Lemma 2 的证明限制"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致的原始递归公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>；采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2048e5139e9d29b\" href=\"?note=f2048e5139e9d29b\" title=\"67-lem-orey-hajek\">67-lem-orey-hajek</a> 的编码及有限一致性表示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}\">\\(\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright k\">\\(S\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1a290c8b2ced7932\" href=\"?note=1a290c8b2ced7932\" title=\"67-df-local-interpretability\">67-df-local-interpretability</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd T\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nS\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}T\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (S\\upharpoonright k\\unlhd T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\unlhd T\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nS\\unlhd_{\\mathrm{loc}}T\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (S\\upharpoonright k\\unlhd T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>旧稿实际陈述的是普通一阶紧致性，未表达书中 Theorem 5；现恢复有限源片段的可解释性与整个源理论可解释性的等价。</p>\n<p>来源说明由 Lemma 2 推出。向右限制源公理即可；向左对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 使有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright k\">\\(S\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 在自身代码上被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 截断后不变，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright k\\unlhd T\">\\(S\\upharpoonright k\\unlhd T\\)</span> 应用 Lemma 2 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{S\\upharpoonright k}\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{S\\upharpoonright k}\\)</span>，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 应用 Lemma 2。所用翻译可随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 改变。第 92 页图像已核对。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Theorem 5，印刷页 81；PDF 第 92 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对 Theorem 5 陈述和从 Lemma 2 的推导；底层算术化完备性保留 Lemma 2 的证明限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":